flowchart LR
    Student[Student browser] --> HTTP[WebController / Flask]
    HTTP --> IO[IOManager: validate inputs]
    IO --> SVC[CheckinService]
    SVC --> AI[AIManager: prompt, retries, JSON schema]
    AI --> Contract{{AIProvider interface}}
    Contract --> Gemini[GeminiProvider: live API]
    Contract --> Fake[FunctionProvider: tests]
    AI -->|validated AI JSON| Logic[LogicManager: deterministic audit, BusinessRule polymorphism]
    Logic -->|evaluated| Data[DataManager: opt-in, privacy, filter]
    AI -->|API failure; no evaluated result| Pending[Pending/Retry path]
    Pending --> Data
    Data --> Backend{{StorageBackend contract}}
    Backend --> File[JSONStorage: atomic JSON file]
    Backend --> Memory[In-memory test backend]
    Logic --> Result[Allow-listed student result]
    Result --> HTTP
    Admin[Signed-in admin] --> HTTP
    HTTP -->|authorised| Data
    Data --> Cohort[CohortReport: anonymised counts, means, tiers]
    Cohort --> HTTP
    HTTP -->|summary without IDs or text| Admin
